{"data":{"description":"Tarp is a waterproof crafting component, used in 17 recipes such as the [Hazmat Suit](/items/hazmat-suit), Battering Ram, [Parachute](/items/parachute) and [Composter](/items/composter). You can't craft it, so the best way to get it is Underwater Advanced Crates, with a 37.73% chance of 1-3. Tunnel Dwellers (15.42%) and yellow and [blue loot barrels](/world/loot-barrel-2) (8.03%) drop it too. Recycling also works: 28 items can give tarp, and a Hazmat Suit yields 2 in a Green Recycler.","item":{"id":"tarp","name":"Tarp","path":"/v1/items/tarp.json","slug":"tarp"},"name":"Tarp","path":"/v1/recycler/tarp.json","recyclers":[{"guaranteed":[{"amount":75,"item":{"id":"cloth","name":"Cloth","path":"/v1/items/cloth.json","slug":"cloth"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-red","name":"Red Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-red.json","slug":"recycler-red"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":60,"item":{"id":"cloth","name":"Cloth","path":"/v1/items/cloth.json","slug":"cloth"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-green-powered","name":"Green Recycler (powered)","path":"/v1/world/recycler-green-powered.json","slug":"recycler-green-powered"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":50,"item":{"id":"cloth","name":"Cloth","path":"/v1/items/cloth.json","slug":"cloth"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-green","name":"Green Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-green.json","slug":"recycler-green"}},{"guaranteed":[{"amount":40,"item":{"id":"cloth","name":"Cloth","path":"/v1/items/cloth.json","slug":"cloth"}}],"recycler":{"id":"recycler-yellow","name":"Yellow Recycler","path":"/v1/world/recycler-yellow.json","slug":"recycler-yellow"}}],"shortName":"tarp"},"meta":{"apiVersion":"v1","dataset":{"createdAt":"2026-11-05T05:52:09+00:00","previousVersion":"2026-10","version":"2026-11"},"schemaVersion":1,"source":{"name":"rusthelp.com","url":"https://rusthelp.com"}}}
